			description: [
				"the pack splits into two paths here: tech and magic."
				""
				"tech is gregtech -- steam to steel to circuits to endgame. magic is a separate progression that skips gregtech almost entirely."
				""
				"you can do one, the other, or both. running both opens options neither has alone, and you can also ignore magic and play pure gregtech."
				""
				"check off the path you want. the matching questbook opens from there, and you can pick up the other one later."
